Changes: their imports point at this package, pretty_enum_name moved to
properties.py from the library's utils module, and the files are formatted with
black. In features.py, for_ac_mode accepts a mode that is not in its tables, such as
the NONE that an unknown mode byte decodes to.

device.py is based on the library's device/__init__.py, with its transport
replaced, turn_on_in_mode added, and per-axis swing commands kept when the merit string
does not declare their positions. Entering and leaving 8 °C mode also send a target, and the
earlier target is kept for one visit to that mode. A status or mode outside the unit's
features is refused with HomeAssistantError only if the command sets it.
